{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact · {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1724; --panel:#0b1220; --accent:#7dd3fc; --muted:#9ca3af; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --accent-2:#fbcfe8; --accent-3:#c7f9cc;
      font-synthesis:none; color-scheme:dark;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg),#071028);}
    /* Diagonal split header */
    .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:48px 24px 64px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center}
    .hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.06;background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="600" height="400"><defs><pattern id="p" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(25)"><rect width="40" height="40" fill="%23070a13"/><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2.5" fill="%236fdffb"/></pattern></defs><rect width="100%" height="100%25" fill="url(%23p)"/></svg>');background-size:cover;mix-blend-mode:overlay}
    nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    .brand .name{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.6px}
    .brand .tag{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .navlinks{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .navlinks a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px}
    .navlinks a.cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#a78bfa);color:#041025;font-weight:600}

    .lead{color:#e6eef8}
    .sub{color:var(--muted);max-width:46ch}

    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 4px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);}
    .panel h3{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--accent-2)}

    /* Widgets grid */
    .grid{display:grid;gap:18px}
    .session-builder{padding:18px}
    label{display:block;margin:8px 0 4px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    input[type=text],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:var(--glass);color:#e6eef8}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row > *{flex:1}
    button{background:var(--accent);border:none;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:#02111a;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .alt{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}
    pre{white-space:pre-wrap;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:#dff7ff;margin:0;font-size:13px}

    /* Seats and calendar */
    .events-list{display:grid;gap:12px}
    .event{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent)}
    .event .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .seats{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .seat{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);cursor:pointer}
    .seat.selected{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#a78bfa);color:#041025;font-weight:700}

    /* packing list */
    .pack{padding:12px}
    ul.packlist{margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)}

    footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:28px 24px 64px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .disclaimer{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}

    @media (max-width:980px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.brand{margin-bottom:8px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="hero">
    <div>
      <nav>
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="name">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="tag">A gentle sound experience in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="navlinks">
          <a href="/index.html">Gatherings</a>
          <a href="/events.html">Circles</a>
          <a href="/private-sessions.html">Privates</a>
          <a href="/pricing.html">Rates</a>
          <a href="/about.html">Who we are</a>
          <a href="/faq.html">Queries</a>
          <a href="/book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="lead">Let's plan something resonant.</h1>
      <p class="sub">Questions, bookings, or curious plans — this page is where we shape a session that fits your rhythm. Try the Session Planner to craft a short blueprint and grab a plaintext summary to share.</p>

      <div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="cta" style="text-decoration:none;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;">Secure a spot</a>
        <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" class="alt" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;">Call us: {{PHONE}}</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <aside class="panel">
      <h3>Quick details</h3>
      <div class="grid">
        <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Model: cohort waves & private flows</div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <main style="padding:18px 24px 36px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:18px">

    <!-- Left column: Session Planner + Contact form -->
    <section class="panel" style="padding:18px;">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent-3)">Session Planner</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px">Build a simple plan for a single session or a short cohort. Export a one-page summary to copy into an email or your notes.</p>

      <div class="session-builder">
        <label for="type">Choose a session type</label>
        <select id="type">
          <option value="dropin">Drop-in Circle — 75 min</option>
          <option value="mini">Cohort Wave — 4-week series</option>
          <option value="private">Solo Resonance — private session</option>
        </select>

        <div class="row" style="margin-top:10px">
          <div>
            <label for="date">Preferred date</label>
            <input id="date" type="text" placeholder="e.g. 2026-03-10 or flexible">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="time">Time</label>
            <input id="time" type="text" placeholder="evening, morning, or a time">
          </div>
        </div>

        <label for="intention">What would you like this session to focus on?</label>
        <input id="intention" type="text" placeholder="e.g. rest, focus, releasing tension">

        <label for="instruments">Preferred sound palette</label>
        <select id="instruments">
          <option value="gongs">Gongs + crystal bowls</option>
          <option value="bowls">Crystal bowls + voice</option>
          <option value="soft">Tibetan bowls + chimes</option>
          <option value="mixed">Mixed acoustic textures</option>
        </select>

        <label for="notes">Notes for the facilitator (optional)</label>
        <textarea id="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Any access needs or group notes"></textarea>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
          <button id="build">Craft summary</button>
          <button id="clear" class="alt">Reset</button>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <label>Plaintext summary</label>
          <pre id="summary">No summary yet — build one above.</pre>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button id="copy">Copy summary</button>
            <button id="send-email" class="alt">Open email with summary</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);margin:18px 0">

      <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--accent-2)">Contact form</h3>
      <form id="contactForm">
        <label for="name">Your name</label>
        <input id="name" required type="text" placeholder="Name">
        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input id="email" required type="text" placeholder="you@example.com">
        <label for="message">Message</label>
        <textarea id="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us about what you're looking for"></textarea>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
          <button type="submit">Send message</button>
          <button type="button" class="alt" id="prefill">Prefill from planner</button>
        </div>
        <div id="sent" style="color:var(--accent-3);display:none;margin-top:8px">Message prepared. In a real site this would be sent to {{EMAIL}}.</div>
      </form>

      <div style="margin-top:14px" class="disclaimer">
        <strong>Contraindications</strong>
        <p style="margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Sound baths are gentle but may not be suitable for certain conditions (e.g., pregnancy in late stages, epilepsy, certain acute psychiatric conditions, or recent head/neck surgery). If you have a medical concern, please consult a healthcare provider before attending and notify us in notes.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Right column: Events, seat selector, packing list -->
    <aside>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent-2)">Next gatherings</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px">Upcoming dates — pick seats and get a custom packing list based on your choices.</p>

        <div class="events-list" id="events">
          <!-- events injected by JS -->
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <label>Selected seats: <span id="seatCount">0</span></label>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button id="decrease" class="alt">-</button>
            <button id="increase">+</button>
            <button id="generatePack" class="alt">Generate packing list</button>
          </div>

          <div class="pack" style="margin-top:10px">
            <strong>What to bring</strong>
            <ul class="packlist" id="packlist">
              <li>Blanket or extra layer</li>
              <li>Yoga mat or cushion</li>
              <li>Water bottle</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div style="height:18px"></div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--accent-2)">Quick contact</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 8px">Call or email to ask about accommodations or to reserve a small block for a group.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
          <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" class="alt" style="text-decoration:none;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;display:block;text-align:center">Call {{PHONE}}</a>
          <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" class="cta" style="text-decoration:none;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;display:block;text-align:center">Message us</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>
      <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — cohort & private sessions</div>
      <div style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)">Prefer a different timeframe? Use the Session Planner, then drop that summary into an email.</div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:right">
      <div style="color:var(--muted)">Registered contact:</div>
      <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-3);margin-top:6px">{{EMAIL}}</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Minimal local state
    const eventsData = [
      {id:1,title:'Evening Circle — Gong + Bowls',date:'2026-02-28',time:'7:00 PM',available:12},
      {id:2,title:'Weekend Mini Wave — 4 sessions',date:'2026-03-06',time:'10:00 AM',available:6},
      {id:3,title:'Early Morning Rest',date:'2026-03-12',time:'8:00 AM',available:10}
    ];

    // Render events
    const eventsEl = document.getElementById('events');
    function renderEvents(){
      eventsEl.innerHTML = '';
      eventsData.forEach(ev=>{
        const div = document.createElement('div');
        div.className = 'event';
        div.innerHTML = '<div><div style="font-weight:700;color:#dff7ff">'+ev.title+'</div><div class="meta">'+ev.date+' · '+ev.time+'</div></div>'+
                        '<div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center"><div class="meta">Seats: '+ev.available+'</div><div>'+
                        '<button class="alt" data-id="'+ev.id+'" style="padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px">Reserve</button></div></div>';
        eventsEl.appendChild(div);
      });
    }
    renderEvents();

    // Fake seat selector (global counter)
    let selectedSeats = 0;
    const seatCountEl = document.getElementById('seatCount');
    document.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click',()=>{ selectedSeats++; updateSeat(); });
    document.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click',()=>{ if(selectedSeats>0) selectedSeats--; updateSeat(); });
    function updateSeat(){ seatCountEl.textContent = selectedSeats; }

    // Generate packing list based on selections
    document.getElementById('generatePack').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const pack = new Set(['Blanket or extra layer','Yoga mat or cushion','Water bottle']);
      if(selectedSeats>=2) pack.add('Shared eye pillow');
      const instr = document.getElementById('instruments').value;
      if(instr==='gongs') pack.add('Ear-friendly buffer (if sensitive to low tones)');
      if(instr==='bowls') pack.add('Soft socks for shared acoustic bowl spaces');
      if(document.getElementById('type').value==='private') pack.add('Short intake note for facilitator');
      const list = document.getElementById('packlist'); list.innerHTML = '';
      pack.forEach(i=>{ const li=document.createElement('li'); li.textContent=i; list.appendChild(li); });
    });

    // Session Planner: build summary, copy, open email
    const buildBtn = document.getElementById('build');
    const clearBtn = document.getElementById('clear');
    const summaryEl = document.getElementById('summary');
    const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copy');
    const sendEmail = document.getElementById('send-email');

    function makeSummary(){
      const type = document.getElementById('type').value;
      const date = document.getElementById('date').value || 'Flexible';
      const time = document.getElementById('time').value || 'Flexible';
      const intention = document.getElementById('intention').value || 'General ease and presence';
      const instr = document.getElementById('instruments').value;
      const notes = document.getElementById('notes').value || '';

      const humanType = (type==='dropin')? 'Drop-in Circle (75 min)' : (type==='mini')? 'Cohort Wave (4-week)' : 'Solo Resonance (private)';

      let text = '';
      text += 'Session plan — '+humanType+"\n";
      text += 'Preferred: '+date+' · '+time+"\n";
      text += 'Intention: '+intention+"\n";
      text += 'Sound palette: '+instr+"\n";
      if(notes) text += 'Notes: '+notes+"\n";
      text += 'Seats requested: '+selectedSeats+"\n";
      text += '— End of summary —';
      return text;
    }

    buildBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const txt = makeSummary();
      summaryEl.textContent = txt;
    });
    clearBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      document.getElementById('date').value='';
      document.getElementById('time').value='';
      document.getElementById('intention').value='';
      document.getElementById('notes').value='';
      selectedSeats = 0; updateSeat();
      summaryEl.textContent = 'No summary yet — build one above.';
    });

    copyBtn.addEventListener('click',async ()=>{
      const txt = summaryEl.textContent || '';
      try{ await navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt); copyBtn.textContent='Copied!'; setTimeout(()=>copyBtn.textContent='Copy summary',1500); }
      catch(e){ alert('Copy not available — please select and copy manually.'); }
    });

    sendEmail.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const body = encodeURIComponent(summaryEl.textContent || makeSummary());
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Session plan — '+(document.getElementById('type').value||'plan'));
      window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;
    });

    // Prefill contact form from planner
    document.getElementById('prefill').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      document.getElementById('message').value = summaryEl.textContent || makeSummary();
    });

    // Handle fake form submit
    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit',(e)=>{
      e.preventDefault();
      document.getElementById('sent').style.display='block';
    });

    // Event reserve buttons (local simulation)
    eventsEl.addEventListener('click',e=>{
      const btn = e.target.closest('button');
      if(!btn) return;
      const id = Number(btn.dataset.id);
      const ev = eventsData.find(x=>x.id===id);
      if(!ev) return;
      if(ev.available<=0){ alert('No seats left for this session.'); return; }
      const take = Number(prompt('How many seats to reserve?','1')) || 0;
      if(take<=0) return;
      if(take>ev.available){ alert('Not enough seats available.'); return; }
      ev.available -= take; renderEvents();
      selectedSeats = Math.max(selectedSeats, take); updateSeat();
      alert('Reserved '+take+' seat(s) for '+ev.title+'. This is a local demo only.');
    });

    // Initial seat update
    updateSeat();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# contact.html and usage

This chunk includes two files for the sound bath site: contact.html and this README.

Files:
- contact.html — a self-contained contact page and interactive playground.
  - Session Planner: build session summaries (drop-in, cohort, private), export a plaintext summary with a copy button, and open your email client with the summary prefilled.
  - Event seat selector (local demo): shows upcoming events, allows simple local reservations, and updates seat counts.
  - Packing list generator: uses the seat count and planner choices to produce a tailored "what to bring" list.
  - Contact form: demo-only; "Send message" toggles a prepared state and "Prefill from planner" copies planner summary into the message field.
  - Contraindications: responsibly noted in a visible panel.

Notes for integration:
- Replace placeholders: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.
- No external assets are required; the page embeds a small SVG pattern as a data URI for subtle texture.
- All interactive features are local-only and do not send data to a server.

Developer hints:
- The events list is seeded in the page (eventsData). In a production build, swap that for a dynamic feed or server-rendered list.
- The planner summary is plain text to keep copy/paste and email compatibility simple.
- Accessibility: controls are basic inputs with labeled fields — consider adding ARIA roles for richer experiences.

This file set follows the project rules for a playful, premium voice and a cohort-focused offer model. The page uses a split/diagonal aesthetic and different navigation labels than other templates to ensure uniqueness."}
BUNDLE_END
